  "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14129810/assets/2ab6b0b0ee673daa81115356c1f5c14d4aba1699660b3229b94f363bfdc7ab17.png)\n\nWhat picture is missing from the multiplication model above?",
  "worked_solution": "In the model, we have $\\frac{2}{4}$ multiplied by $3.$ This means that we need to make $3$ copies of the given fraction model.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14129810/assets/d5117fc997840e7a2304caca1f245a65fdf36f6db2fddc48b2dc1957eb1b00fa.png)\n\n \n\nSo, the missing picture is:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14129810/assets/ab1f96c56e779079e9851e64496693d51183435a8e54dc2f80447bb54c0150a4.png)",
